  <NAME>mRNA Sequencing of BC-1 Cells</NAME>
  <TITLE>mRNA Sequencing of BC-1 Cells</TITLE>
  <DESCRIPTION>Kaposi’s sarcoma-associated herpesvirus (KSHV) causes the B cell malignancy primary effusion lymphoma (PEL). Here we performed mRNA sequencing to characterize the mRNA expression profile of the primary effusion lymhoma (PEL) cell line BC-1. Overall design: BC-1 cells (ATCC CRL-2230) submitted for standard mRNA sequencing</DESCRIPTION>
